{"name": "RhythmArc", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4362390/extras_big/460e8c794561c844a408a6c6966505fd.webp?t=1795195045\" height=\"124\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4362390/extras/460e8c794561c844a408a6c6966505fd.avif?t=1795195045\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">RhythmArc is a fast-paced rhythm FPS with roguelike builds. Time your shots to the music and make every bullet part of the beat. Dash, jump, and weave through the air as you find your own rhythm in combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"330\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4362390/extras/406335967485b9df74fd7dc1036bcfda.poster.avif?t=1795195045\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4362390/extras/406335967485b9df74fd7dc1036bcfda.webm?t=1795195045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4362390/extras/406335967485b9df74fd7dc1036bcfda.mp4?t=1795195045\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img alt=\"Shoot to the beat and tear through high-speed firefights!\" class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4362390/extras_big/9853f0db6cd7a56b505cb163d903222f.webp?t=1795195045\" height=\"124\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4362390/extras/9853f0db6cd7a56b505cb163d903222f.avif?t=1795195045\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fire in time with the music. Land a hit within the perfect timing window to deal more damage, build your combo, and earn more APEX energy. The tighter your timing, the harder every hit lands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4362390/extras_big/e187484a16213ddd0aa339fa9de16c43.webp?t=1795195045\" height=\"124\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4362390/extras/e187484a16213ddd0aa339fa9de16c43.avif?t=1795195045\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dash, chain jumps, grind rails, and swing through the arena with your grappling hook. Weave through swarms of enemies and incoming fire to find your opening. Execute enemies to absorb shields and keep moving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"330\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4362390/extras/24a4d2f02cc6e79a26497c535052b5e0.poster.avif?t=1795195045\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4362390/extras/24a4d2f02cc6e79a26497c535052b5e0.webm?t=1795195045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4362390/extras/24a4d2f02cc6e79a26497c535052b5e0.mp4?t=1795195045\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4362390/extras_big/87f0cd05e30ef34378de785730e94905.webp?t=1795195045\" height=\"124\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4362390/extras/87f0cd05e30ef34378de785730e94905.avif?t=1795195045\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick up random abilities and upgrades as you go, and build around the choices each run gives you. Experiment with different combinations, find a playstyle that clicks, and take on tougher enemies as the fight evolves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4362390/extras_big/8fe0f2c6fda8b6b62f6705450a101d50.webp?t=1795195045\" height=\"124\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4362390/extras/8fe0f2c6fda8b6b62f6705450a101d50.avif?t=1795195045\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Blast your way through futuristic arenas to a pulse of electronic music. Gunfire, particle effects, and the beat come together in one high-speed firefight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4362390/extras_big/229f893ba9d318c7c54bd0bae9fb4f92.webp?t=1795195045\" height=\"124\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4362390/extras/229f893ba9d318c7c54bd0bae9fb4f92.avif?t=1795195045\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play official albums across a range of styles, or import your favorite tracks and fight to your own soundtrack. Steam Workshop support is planned, so you\u2019ll be able to discover more music and ways to play from the community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"494\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4362390/extras/23206e5dd1bff7967ad033478600b25b.poster.avif?t=1795195045\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4362390/extras/23206e5dd1bff7967ad033478600b25b.webm?t=1795195045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4362390/extras/23206e5dd1bff7967ad033478600b25b.mp4?t=1795195045\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4362390/extras_big/d29d9d72f2ac146335788d80a03d1e85.webp?t=1795195045\" height=\"124\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4362390/extras/d29d9d72f2ac146335788d80a03d1e85.avif?t=1795195045\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Add RhythmArc to your Steam wishlist and follow the game for development updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Our Discord\uff1a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "RhythmArc is a fast-paced rhythm-driven FPS roguelike that fuses precise shooting, high-mobility combat, and pulsating electronic music into one relentless audiovisual experience.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4362390/c7351cc72eb33ab3bddd5560a75e29d78b2ebd8c/header.jpg?t=1795195045", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Action", "FPS", "Rhythm", "Music", "Roguelike", "Fast-Paced"], "developers": "Unicat", "publishers": "Unicat", "release_date": "To be announced", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4362390", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "20 November 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/7Hq23KVN9bk", "first_seen": 1795129200.0, "review_rank": 28}